516	HIZMET SOZLESMESI OZETI (Anadolu Kart Bank Tahsilat API v1, taban yol /api/v1)
517	Tum uclar POST, JSON. Yanitta ok=false ise islem yapilmadi (error alani); HTTP 5
518	00 ise hicbir sey kaydedilmedi, tekrar denenebilir.
519	verify_identity: customer_id, field (birth_year|postcode), answer. Yanit: verifi
520	ed, attempts_remaining, identity_complete.
521	get_account: customer_id. Yanit: products[product_id, card_last4, past_due, days
522	_late, minimum_payment]. Kimlik tamamlanmadan reddedilir.
523	create_promise: customer_id, product_id, amount, payment_date (YYYY-MM-DD). Yani
524	t: promise_id. Hatalar: invalid_date, below_minimum, above_past_due.
525	add_note: customer_id, text.
526	schedule_callback: customer_id, callback_date, callback_time (HH:MM). Hata: outs
527	ide_window.
528	transfer_to_agent: customer_id, reason (hardship|dispute).
529	close_call: customer_id, outcome, reason. Son cagri; sonrasi call_closed.
530	Tam sema icin hizmet_sozlesmesi.json dosyasina bakin.
